OL,3,AMeta's $18bn settlement may hasten
OL,4,Areckoning for social media on child
OL,5,Asafety
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeta's decision to settle the case on
OL,8,FWednesday came as a surprise.
OL,10,FI was expecting weeks of courtroom
OL,11,Fdrama as 29 states ` almost two-thirds
OL,12,Fof North America - took on one US tech
OL,13,Fgiant.
OL,15,FTechnically, the trial was about
OL,16,Fchildren's online privacy. It was based
OL,17,Fon a US law called the Children's
OL,18,FOnline Privacy Protection Act (COPPA),
OL,19,Fwhich is nearly 30 years old and
OL,20,Fpredates all of today's biggest social
OL,21,Fplatforms.
