OL,3,AMeta's $18bn settlement may hasten
OL,4,Areckoning for social media on child
OL,5,Asafety
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt centred around Meta's historic
OL,8,Fgathering and use of data belonging to
OL,9,Fchildren under the age of 13 over a
OL,10,Fperiod of several years.
